WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Ryu falls after the prerequisite Justice Beyond knockdown.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.650
Light-plus-medium-kick OD Divine Pillar is placed before the wake-up.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.500
The light Ghastly Interrogation attempt misses as the Pillar launches Ryu.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Light Cruel Shoulder contacts the Pillar while Ryu is airborne.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.150
Justice Beyond automatically swings the Pillar after the Shoulder contact.

6
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.350
Heavy-kick Indomitable Defense leads into the heavy-punch Moral Breakdown startup.

7
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.300
Moral Breakdown completes the performed stance conversion.
